# ABP Distributed Locking

## Using Distributed Lock
```csharp
public class MyService : ITransientDependency
{
    private readonly IAbpDistributedLock _distributedLock;

    public async Task ProcessAsync(string resourceId)
    {
        await using var handle = await _distributedLock.TryAcquireAsync(
            $"MyResource:{resourceId}",
            timeout: TimeSpan.FromSeconds(30)
        );

        if (handle != null)
        {
            // Lock acquired, do work
        }
        else
        {
            // Lock not acquired, handle accordingly
        }
    }
}
```

## Configuration
Configure Redis or another provider for distributed scenarios:
```csharp
Configure<AbpDistributedLockOptions>(options =>
{
    options.KeyPrefix = "MyApp";
});
```

## Default Behavior
- Works in-process by default
- Configure a distributed provider (Redis) for clustered deployments
